- PSST.
YOU MISSED A SPOT.
- PSST。
你错过了一个地方。

07:27.227 --> 07:30.627
- ALL RIGHT, I RECKON THE YARD
IS GOOD AND WATERED.
- 好吧，我算了一下院子
很好并且浇过水。

07:30.727 --> 07:32.260
- PSST.
YOU MISSED A SPOT.
- PSST。
你错过了一个地方。

07:32.360 --> 07:34.294
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

07:36.494 --> 07:38.594
WHEW.
哇。

07:41.494 --> 07:42.594
- ATTA BOY, SQUIDDY.
- 阿塔男孩，鱿鱼。

07:42.694 --> 07:44.660
BE SURE TO TWIST THAT TORSO.
一定要扭转躯干。

07:44.760 --> 07:46.494
- HEY, SANDY.
- 嘿，桑迪。

07:46.594 --> 07:48.794
I DON'T REMEMBER THIS
BEING A PART OF MY TRAINING.
我不记得了
成为我训练的一部分。

07:48.894 --> 07:51.227
IT WASN'T,
BUT TODAY IS CHORE DAY.
事实并非如此，
但今天是家务日。

07:51.327 --> 07:54.027
SO I FIGURED WHY NOT
FRY TWO FISH IN ONE SKILLET.
所以我想为什么不呢
一锅煎两条鱼。

07:54.127 --> 07:55.494
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

07:55.560 --> 07:58.627
- THAT'S IT.
I AM OUTTA HERE!
- 就是这样。
我要离开这里！

07:58.727 --> 08:01.627
THIS IS A NO GOOD
WASTE OF MY TIME.
这不好
浪费我的时间。

08:01.727 --> 08:03.227
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

08:04.494 --> 08:05.527
HEY, I'M DOING IT.
嘿，我正在做。

08:05.627 --> 08:07.060
I'M BLOCKING THE ACORNS.
我正在阻止橡子。

08:07.160 --> 08:09.627
- YEE-HAW!
I TOLD YOU ALL YOU HAD TO DO
- 呀呀！
我告诉了你所有你必须做的

08:09.727 --> 08:12.594
WAS KNOW THE MOVEMENTS
OF EVERY DAY TO MASTER KARATE.
知道动作
每天掌握空手道。

08:12.694 --> 08:14.427
- [laughs]
I CAN'T BELIEVE I DID IT!
- [笑]
我不敢相信我做到了！

08:14.527 --> 08:15.760
- YEAH! YEAH!
NOW TRY THIS!
- 是的！是的！
现在试试这个！

08:15.860 --> 08:16.760
- OKAY,
OKAY.
- 好吧，
好的。

08:16.860 --> 08:17.794
HI-YAH!
嗨呀！

08:19.460 --> 08:21.794
- [laughs]
I DID IT!
- [笑]
我做到了！

08:23.494 --> 08:26.460
HI-YAH!
嗨呀！

08:26.560 --> 08:28.927
I CAN PROTECT
MY GROCERIES NOW!
我可以保护
我的杂货现在！

08:29.027 --> 08:30.394
HI-YAH!
嗨呀！

08:30.494 --> 08:32.827
[crash]
[碰撞]

08:32.927 --> 08:35.194
I AM A KARATE MASTER.
我是空手道大师。

08:35.294 --> 08:36.994
WHOO-HOO-HOO!
呼呼呼！

08:37.094 --> 08:38.760
- WELL,
I WOULDN'T GO THAT FAR,
- 嗯，
我不会走那么远，

08:38.860 --> 08:40.560
BUT YOU HAVE PROVEN
YOURSELF WORTHY OF
但你已经证明了
你自己值得

08:40.660 --> 08:43.660
THE BELT
OF BASIC COMPETENCE.
腰带
的基本能力。

08:43.760 --> 08:44.727
- YEAH, YEAH.
THAT'S GREAT, THANKS.
- 是啊是啊。
太好了，谢谢。

08:44.827 --> 08:49.127
BUT I HAVE SOME BUSINESS
TO ATTEND TO.
但我还有事
参加。

08:49.227 --> 08:50.460
- [laughs]
- [笑]

08:50.560 --> 08:51.627
WHAT'S THIS?
这是什么？

08:51.727 --> 08:54.694
DO I FIND MYSELF ON THIS
DARK AND SCARY STREET
我在这方面找到了自己吗
黑暗恐怖的街道

08:54.794 --> 08:55.894
YET AGAIN?
又来了？

08:55.994 --> 09:00.760
WE'LL JUST SEE
WHAT HAPPENS THIS TIME.
我们拭目以待
这次会发生什么。

09:00.860 --> 09:02.894
- HEY, YOU!
- 嘿，你！

09:02.994 --> 09:05.794
- LET ME GIVE A TASTE,
A MERE MORSEL
- 让我尝尝，
一点点

09:05.894 --> 09:07.327
OR WHAT'S IN STORE.
或者有什么。

09:07.427 --> 09:10.260
HI-YAH!
HI-YAH!
嗨呀！
嗨呀！

09:10.360 --> 09:11.594
HI-YAH!
嗨呀！

09:11.694 --> 09:15.827
THAT ONE WAS CALLED
"WASHING SANDY'S WINDOWS".
那一个被称为
“清洗桑迪的窗户”。

09:17.360 --> 09:19.794
STAY BACK
OR YOU'RE GOING TO GET IT.
退后一步
否则你就会得到它。

09:19.894 --> 09:21.394
I AM WARNING YOU.
我警告你。

09:21.494 --> 09:24.160
- [wheezing]
- [喘息]

09:24.260 --> 09:25.994
- OKAY, BUDDY.
I WARNED YOU.
- 好吧，伙计。
我警告过你。

09:26.094 --> 09:29.494
I LIKE TO CALL THIS ONE
"TAKING OUT SANDY'S TRASH".
我喜欢称呼这个为
“倒掉桑迪的垃圾”。

09:29.594 --> 09:31.027
HI-YAH!
嗨呀！

09:31.127 --> 09:32.527
- WHAT? OW!
- 什么？噢！

09:32.627 --> 09:33.560
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:33.660 --> 09:34.994
HOW DO YOU LIKE
THEM APPLES?
你觉得怎么样
他们是苹果吗？

09:35.094 --> 09:36.760
WAAH!
哇啊！

09:36.860 --> 09:38.394
- OH! OW!
- 哦！噢！

09:38.494 --> 09:40.760
- HA, FEEL MY WRATH.
- 哈，感受我的愤怒。

09:40.860 --> 09:42.094
HOW'S YOUR UNCLE?
你叔叔怎么样？

09:42.194 --> 09:44.027
- OW! OW.
- 噢！哦。

09:44.127 --> 09:47.360
- AND, AS MY FINISHING MOVE,
I GIVE YOU
- 而且，作为我的最后一步，
我给你

09:47.494 --> 09:49.894
"WATERING SANDY'S LAWN".
“给桑迪的草坪浇水”。

09:49.994 --> 09:51.494
BEE-YAH!
哎呀！

09:55.794 --> 09:56.794
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:56.894 --> 09:59.727
HEY, MAN.
WH-WHAT WAS THAT FOR?
嘿，伙计。
那是什么？

09:59.827 --> 10:01.194
I WAS JUST TRYING TO
GIVE YOU BACK
我只是想
还给你

10:01.294 --> 10:03.127
YOUR GROCERIES
YOU DROPPED.
你的杂货
你掉队了。

10:03.227 --> 10:04.294
- UH, OH.
- 呃，哦。

10:04.394 --> 10:06.694
- SANDY, I FOUND HIM.
HE'S OVER HERE.
- 桑迪，我找到他了。
他在这儿。

10:06.794 --> 10:08.860
YOU FORGOT
YOUR BELT, SILLY.
你忘记了
你的腰带，傻瓜。

10:08.960 --> 10:10.260
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:10.360 --> 10:12.127
- GOSH,
WHAT HAPPENED TO YOU?
- 天哪，
你怎么了？

10:12.227 --> 10:15.027
- THIS GUY'S BEEN KARATE'D.
- 这家伙学过空手道。

10:15.127 --> 10:19.494
- AFTER ALL I SAID ABOUT NEVER
USING KARATE FOR REVENGE?
- 毕竟我说过从来没有
用空手道复仇？

10:19.594 --> 10:23.094
- FOR SHAME, SQUIDWARD.
FOR SHAME.
- 耻辱，章鱼哥。
耻辱。

10:23.194 --> 10:25.527
- LOOKS LIKE HE'S NOT WORTHY
OF THIS BELT AFTER ALL.
- 看起来他不值得
毕竟是这条腰带。

10:25.627 --> 10:29.827
THANKS FOR DISHONORING
OUR TRUST IN YOU, SQUIDWARD.
感谢您的羞辱
我们信任你，章鱼哥。

10:29.927 --> 10:33.360
- WHATEVER.
I'M STILL A KARATE MASTER.
- 任何。
我仍然是空手道大师。

10:33.494 --> 10:35.160
- WOW, REALLY?
YOU ARE?
- 哇，真的吗？
你是？

10:35.260 --> 10:36.494
- YES, I AM.
- 我是。

10:36.560 --> 10:38.627
- HEY, WATCH YOUR HEAD.
- 嘿，小心你的头。

10:38.727 --> 10:39.960
I'D NEVER GUESS IT.
我绝对猜不到。

10:40.060 --> 10:42.094
- AND WHAT IS THAT
SUPPOSED TO MEAN?
-那是什么
应该是什么意思？

10:42.194 --> 10:43.294
- OH, UH, NOTHING.
- 哦，呃，没什么。

10:43.394 --> 10:44.594
JUST WITH THE RUBBERY ARMS,
只需使用橡胶臂，

10:44.694 --> 10:46.527
AND THE DOUGHINESS
IN THE MIDSECTION--
和面团
在中间部分——

10:46.627 --> 10:48.627
- OKAY, ALREADY,
I GET IT.
- 好的，已经，
我明白了。

10:48.727 --> 10:51.494
WHAT, WAIT A SECOND.
AM I UNDER ARREST?
什么，等一下。
我被捕了吗？

10:51.560 --> 10:52.727
- YOU SURE ARE.
- 你确实是。

10:52.827 --> 10:55.060
AND YOU HAVE THE RIGHT
TO REMAIN SILENT...
你有权利
保持沉默...

10:55.160 --> 10:57.060
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

10:57.160 --> 10:58.494
- OR NOT SILENT.
- 或者不保持沉默。

- 或者不保持沉默。